## Node identity and runtime flags for hecate_dronex.
-name ${HECATE_NODE_NAME}@${HECATE_NODE_HOST}
-setcookie ${HECATE_COOKIE}

+K true

## A tick is CPU-bound integer arithmetic over a swarm, and a training round is
## thousands of engagements, so the schedulers are the resource that matters and
## the async thread pool is not on that path. Left at a modest 8 until there is
## something to measure; a number chosen before the first measurement is a guess
## either way, and this one is cheap to revisit.
+A 8
